<https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/SpecificationType/specification> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A specification is a detailed document (or set of documents) that describes the requirements, design, behavior, or other characteristics of a system, component, or process so that all stakeholders have a clear, unambiguous reference."@en .
