<https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/IsoAutomationLevel/conditionalAutomation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Level 3 - Conditional automation. The system can propose strategies and then automatically execute the approved plan, with an external agent being ready to take over when necessary."@en .
